done_means: section {
  | What done means for the unit, as the checklist the build is accepted by. Each item is a
  | `verify` on the component it exercises.
  |
  | - [ ] **Language server:** it works in an editor with diagnostics, completion, hover, go to
  |   definition and rename ([lsp](#architecture.tools.lsp), `scripts/e2e-app.sh`, step `lsp`).
  | - [ ] **Prose linting:** Vale alerts from the team's .vale.ini show in the editor on the
  |   right words of a Heron file, never inside code or links, with their fixes and vocabulary
  |   actions, and unlinked terms are flagged in the sample repository
  |   ([prose](#architecture.tools.prose), `scripts/e2e-lsp.sh`).
  | - [ ] **Docs:** `heron generate docs` produces a working site for the sample repository
  |   ([docs](#architecture.tools.docs), `scripts/e2e-docs.sh`).
}
